<title>HUNGARY: Hungary twelve-month bill yield falls to 21.82 pct.</title>
<headline>Hungary twelve-month bill yield falls to 21.82 pct.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1996-11-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>The average annual yield on the latest issue of twelve-month discount treasury bills was set by auction at 21.82 percent, down from 22.37 percent at an auction two weeks ago, the National Bank of Hungary said.</p>
<p>    Total on offer	    14,000 million forints</p>
<p>    Total bids received     33,069.21 million forints</p>
<p>    Total allocated	   14,000 million forints</p>
<p>    Total issued		15,550 million forints</p>
<p>    Average annual yield	    21.82 pct</p>
<p>    Average price		     82.2094 pct</p>
</text>
